Package: situc
Section: devel
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), ${misc:Depends}
Description: compiler for byte-exact data layouts
 situc compiles a schema describing a byte-exact data layout into encoders,
 decoders and checks, in C, C++, Rust and Python. Capability properties --
 in-place mutability, addressability, canonical encoding, authentication
 coverage -- are inferred statically and reported back to the schema author
 as design feedback rather than discovered at runtime.

Package: libsitu-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: C runtime for code generated by situc
 The static library and header that code generated by situc links against.
 Install this to build a C program around a situ schema.
